{"4483060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "8ave.-Octave-", "steam_appid": 4483060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『<strong>8ave.-Octave-</strong>』 is an 8-keyboard music game featuring a piano motif.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To focus solely on playing the keys, 8ave. eliminates all special controls common in rhythm games, such as flicks and slides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The charts consist only of notes and long notes, allowing you to easily enjoy the feel of playing piano right on your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Gameplay Pursuing Simplicity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only action required is pressing keys on the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex controls common in other rhythm games are needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483060/extras/8ave._2026-03-09_23-23-20-554?t=1780513507\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Extensive Music Library</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The initial version features over 60 songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All songs offer three difficulty levels: EASY/NORMAL/HARD.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Covering a wide range of genres from classic rhythm game staples to exclusive tracks only playable on 8ave.,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with more songs planned for regular updates going forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483060/extras/8ave._2026-03-09_23-18-07-093?t=1780513507\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>◆Challenge the Limit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those confident in their skills, some songs feature MASTER charts—an even higher difficulty 